{"4951520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AstroPoly", "steam_appid": 4951520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D pixel-art mining game about digging through procedurally generated planets and carving your own path through the stars.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated planets</strong> — No two landings are the same. Each visit reshapes the terrain and its risk/reward zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart your own route</strong> — Freely pick your next destination on the star map, weighing distance against danger and opportunity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; collect</strong> — Dig deep to uncover rare ores and fill out your mineral compendium.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up</strong> — Spend your earnings on gear upgrades that make you a faster, tougher, more efficient miner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest</strong> — Grow your fortune beyond mining by putting spare credits into a fluctuating stock market.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-art visuals, full controller support, English &amp; Japanese localization.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D pixel-art mining game about digging through procedurally generated planets and carving your own path through the stars.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated planets</strong> — No two landings are the same. Each visit reshapes the terrain and its risk/reward zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart your own route</strong> — Freely pick your next destination on the star map, weighing distance against danger and opportunity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; collect</strong> — Dig deep to uncover rare ores and fill out your mineral compendium.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragr